        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-091540",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on data collected by IQVIA, we estimate the total addressable market for DDS, including proprietary and contract development manufacturing services, to be approximately $3.6 billion in 2025, and the market is expected to grow at a CAGR of 9% through 2030.",
