        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By developing high-value solutions using our proprietary intellectual property, we are able to create unique and innovative products, processes, and services that can be used across different clients.",
        "start_character": 47451,
        "end_character": 47651
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-091540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-091540-f71ea480f21ddec3",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-091540",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By partnering with customers in the early drug development phase, we are in a prime position to play a key role as they add products to their drug pipelines and seek more advanced technical solutions.",
        "start_character": 27244,
        "end_character": 27444
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-091540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-091540-f71ea480f21ddec3",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-091540",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Development: As part of our product development activities for DDS and IVD we focus our proprietary platforms and CDMO business on design for manufacturing and process engineering for tooling/molding and assembly.",
